scription": "Research-Creation Project: The Polyblocs construction game, integrated into a virtual environment, enables the rapid creation of prototypes, offering a playful and participatory way to shape architectural concepts. The Polyblocs tool provides practitioners with a space for freedom and agency often lacking in conventional architectural design solutions, fostering spontaneous expression in the previsualization process.\n\n", "short_description": "The Polyblocs construction game, integrated into a virtual environment, enables rapid prototyping, offering a playful, participatory approach to architectural design while fostering freedom and spontaneity in previsualization.\n\n\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "cov1.png", "id": "2351174138582301", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974759_2351174141915634_2969451169120856586_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=l2DNON4rVMYQ7kNvwGQn5rR&_nc_oc=Adn8I45dC9zI7IHt8ytnwyjll605GHvJJxlxDKlzFebHmjTddIkAFuG7FjOIj2Mf8Fk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsMGr2Ut9-gES53tRvvuqjr7EEiSrEL9zYxnIi0BRBXQw&oe=699B0A89"}, {"file_name": "cov4.png", "id": "1531289950891358", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75485579_1531289954224691_4417623240716955788_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Z63zp0dsAbUQ7kNvwHTjAVh&_nc_oc=AdmYt_gTbpzF1R8I998hYlwD6jl49XzK6DNwIBfdXQuQQ97Vd08MFszIfv6spjhZoWU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afv9aiHJTZOii0KuvI7y1xCFT-c6Ebe_qhLx-g97zlwzeQ&oe=699B08BD"}, {"file_name": "banner pb 1440 1440 v2.png", "id": "1498865307473211", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031361_1498865310806544_8225324080290249197_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Xv2d0ABZpGEQ7kNvwGws0SN&_nc_oc=Adkn2ABvwzq7JsEzMbAX-rbvZ8_9nOgaISiLOSlRIbj7ElbMt8GmYM_DaNGtX-af